[en.CHARACTER_LORD_TIREK_NAME]
Lord Tirek

[en.CHARACTER_LORD_TIREK_DESC]
The elder son of King Vorak, Lord Tirek is the rightful heir to the centaur kingdom. However, his arrogance, recklessness, and greed for magic have made King Vorak favor his younger brother, Scorpan, over him. Centaurs are a long-living species, and Tirek is growing impatient with waiting to inherit the throne.
Therefore, behind his father’s back, Tirek learned dark magic from the elder Sendak, and showed exceptional talent. After being scolded by King Vorak when his secret was revealed, young Tirek swore to leave the land to find more magic and prove his strength to his father.
When Tirek invaded Equestria with Scorpan, the latter, unable to bear watching the ponies’ magic being cruelly taken away by Tirek, betrayed his elder brother and helped the ponies defeat Tirek, who was then imprisoned in Tartarus.
It was not until Tirek accidentally made friends with his pen pal, Cozy Glow, and the arrival of “Grogar”, that Tirek regained his freedom. He finally obtained the power he had longed for: he absorbed almost half of the magic in the central continent of Equestria, becoming a giant and nearly invincible monster.

[zh.CHARACTER_LORD_TIREK_NAME]
提雷克大王

[zh.CHARACTER_LORD_TIREK_DESC]
沃拉克国王的大儿子，虽说本就是半人马王国的正统继承者，但他的自大、鲁莽与对魔力的贪婪，让沃拉克国王从不看好他，而更偏好弟弟斯科潘。半人马恰恰又是长寿的种族，提雷克已经等不及继承王位了。
于是，背着父亲沃拉克，提雷克向长老僧达克学习黑魔法，并展现出过人的天赋。在事情败露遭到沃拉克训斥后，青年提雷克就发誓要离开这片土地，去寻找更多的魔力，然后向父亲展示自己的强大。
当提雷克带着斯科潘入侵小马国的时候，斯科潘因为不忍看到小马们的魔力被提雷克残忍夺走，于是背叛了哥哥，帮助小马国的小马们击败了提雷克，将其关入塔尔塔洛斯监狱。
直到提雷克偶然结交的笔友和煦光流，以及“格罗迦”的到来，让提雷克重获自由，他终于顺利得到了他梦寐以求的力量：他吸取了小马利亚中央大陆几乎一半的魔法，成为了巨型且几乎无敌的怪物。
